"use": "銀行 (large): a three-storey 36 x 22 m main branch -- F1 the ATM corner, the 風除室, the banking hall, high and low teller counters, the back office, the MAIN VAULT (safes, cash cages), 貸金庫 (safe-deposit room), the cash-in-transit bay behind a shutter (MARK_vehicle); F2 consultation booths, the manager's office with its safe, a meeting room, WCs; F3 offices, the server room, lockers, the canteen. Two stairs (A to the roof), a lift. probe_xz is in the hall. kits/interiors/BankLarge.blend (the artist's; a PLACEHOLDER shell and fit-out, ARTIST_NOTES.md lists what to replace)",
